<!--
  DRAFT (not released): table-top insertion around an obstacle. The left hand holds the rod (as in
  scenes/insertion_container.xml); the container (the same blue tube, open at the top) stands upright on the table, and a
  small cylinder stands between where the rod starts and the container. Demonstrations go around it (left) or over it.
  Made from scenes/insertion_container.xml by hand; the three cameras are moved and turned to look at the task (all aimed at (0.58, 0.36, 0.86)).
-->
